{"id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","title":"Abelian Group","display":"df-abelian-group — Abelian Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-abelian-group","aliases":["58-df-abelian-group","Abelian Group"],"display":"df-abelian-group — Abelian Group","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-abelian-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-abelian-group</span><span>Abelian Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abelian-group — Abelian Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4aa9b38cae202a0a\" href=\"?note=4aa9b38cae202a0a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md\">../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in V\">\\(G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot:G\\times G\\to G\">\\(\\cdot:G\\times G\\to G\\)</span> (binary operation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span> (group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Commutative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Commutative}_S\\)</span> (commutativity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4aa9b38cae202a0a\" href=\"?note=4aa9b38cae202a0a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md\">../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (abelian-group predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Abelian}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Abelian}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (operation-free alias defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Commutative}_S(G,\\cdot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Commutative}_S(G,\\cdot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}group\\text{-}implicit}\\vdash \\mathrm{Abelian}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}group\\text{-}implicit}\\vdash \\mathrm{Abelian}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An abelian group is a group whose chosen binary operation is commutative.</li>\n<li>The finitely generated structure theorem is a theorem about abelian groups, not part of this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Hungerford, Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md","status":"resolved","id":"4aa9b38cae202a0a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S$ (group predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md","status":"resolved","id":"4aa9b38cae202a0a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Commutative}_S$ (commutativity predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-commutativity.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot:G\\times G\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Commutative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Abelian}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Commutative}_S(G,\\cdot)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}group\\text{-}implicit}\\vdash \\mathrm{Abelian}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,\\cdot)","display":true}],"bytes":1305,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6b0fdef2692e665","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元